text = "Coin Troll is a low level enemy character who loves collecting coins, even though he was only designed to guard a small part of a level, and his endless obsession soon begins to cause problems within the game, eventually forcing him to run, and that is where his adventure truly begins; Coin Troll Adventure is a hybrid interactive gametoon where you read the story as a scrolling webtoon comic and play through action segments when the story demands it, so every chapter is yours to read, every battle is yours to fight
Read it. Play it. Collect everything."
